name ucd
# The Unicode Character Database in XML (UAX #42), flat form: every codepoint, and every range of codepoints, with
# everything the standard says of it: [codepoint, property, value], the property and the value as the standard writes
# them. A character is the character it is; a range, the path of its first and its last; a value that is itself
# codepoints, the text they are. The standard writes # for the codepoint itself. What the standard leaves empty
# attests nothing. A character's other names, the named sequences, the standardized variants, the radicals and the
# blocks are read the same way: each is the thing its own attribute names.
# Every record is an element on lines of its own: the file is parted before each, and read on every core.
match ucd.all.flat.xml
format xml
# The properties the perf-cache's flags hold for every codepoint (tier0.flags: age, block, script, the categories
# and classes, and every binary property) are read from there, not attested again: 52% of the file's attributes were
# those properties' defaults alone, a row each.
perfcache
split char reserved noncharacter surrogate named-sequence provisional-named-sequence normalization-correction standardized-variant cjk-radical emoji-source block do-not-emit instead
itself-mark hash

thing char cp
thing char first-cp last-cp
thing reserved cp
thing reserved first-cp last-cp
thing noncharacter cp
thing noncharacter first-cp last-cp
thing surrogate cp
thing surrogate first-cp last-cp
thing named-sequence cps
thing provisional-named-sequence cps
thing standardized-variant cps
thing cjk-radical radical
thing block name
codepoints cp first-cp last-cp cps bmg bpb cf dm FC_NFKC lc NFKC_CF NFKC_SCF scf slc stc suc tc uc EqUIdeo ideograph radical-ideograph of use code
omit xmlns
omit description normalization-correction.version
content *

attest char *
attest reserved *
attest noncharacter *
attest surrogate *
attest name-alias alias type
together name-alias
attest named-sequence name
attest provisional-named-sequence name
attest standardized-variant desc when
attest cjk-radical ideograph
attest block first-cp last-cp
attest emoji-source unicode docomo kddi softbank
attest normalization-correction old new version
attest instead of use because
attest description .
